{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object visible, approach and take object, check properties, do specific task, else, search for object. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = SearchForObject    /> <Action ID = ObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = SpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <SubTree ID = MobileRobotTask    />",
